In the DTS  of the board,  will give a freq a kernel freq of 40MHz  from the 80MHz SYSCLOCK  
```
&rcc {
	clocks = <&pll>;
	clock-frequency = <DT_FREQ_M(40)>;
	ahb-prescaler = <2>;
	apb1-prescaler = <1>;
	apb2-prescaler = <1>;
};

```
